config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_435_APOLLIA_HUB
	bool "Contest 2026 team 435 Apollia siren-instrument hub"
	default n
	depends on GRAPHICS_LVGL
	---help---
		Enable the contest 2026 team 435 (UdifyFun) Apollia Hub: a
		round-screen "siren's vortex" visualizer for the wearable
		chord/melody instrument. Touch sensors to play chords and
		melody, drag the core for effect wetness, and stream USB-MIDI
		to the host DAW. See docs/apollia_design.md for the design.
